          "unit_id": "external-unit:curated-source:zhihu_selected_observation:0a1df79e774442ab:11:43a9219b571324ae",
          "text": "双方将共同推动面向量产的Robotaxi方案及试点部署。",
          "unit_hash": "43a9219b571324ae79ae81c29f6040b385b63b5fc308d4de74d5c245ae8c2937",
          "source_id": "curated-source:zhihu_selected_observation:0a1df79e774442ab",
